WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.550 --> 00:00:03.330
Hello and brace yourselves!

00:00:03.330 --> 00:00:09.030
This video is full of cool image examples
like this one with a cute corgi in a house

00:00:09.030 --> 00:00:10.590
made of sushi.

00:00:10.590 --> 00:00:15.040
If you haven’t been living under a rock
– or were busy attending a conference during

00:00:15.040 --> 00:00:19.359
the last days – social media should have
notified you,

00:00:19.359 --> 00:00:26.119
that yet another diffusion model, called Imágen,
or Imagén, is generating images from text

00:00:26.119 --> 00:00:27.730
– and it looks amazing!

00:00:27.730 --> 00:00:33.310
So, let’s take a short coffee break and
discuss how this model works, how it compares

00:00:33.310 --> 00:00:39.090
to previous diffusion models like DALL-E 2
and what criticism still falls onto these

00:00:39.090 --> 00:00:40.090
models.

00:00:40.090 --> 00:00:45.489
But first, thanks a lot to Weights &amp; Biases
for supporting us for this video!

